{"src":"en","tgt":"it","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"it","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7955.316074999999,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8666.689491,"text":"La zona di Shenzhen, tuttavia, funziona in modo simile a un unico paese a questo proposito."},{"kind":"audio","t":8776.768089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8781.167766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8786.178372999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8791.855298,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":8792.34364,"samples":6328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":15115.473638,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":15862.901313999999,"text":"Situata sulla cima di una delle montagne a nord della Mecca, la grotta è strettamente"},{"kind":"audio","t":15966.438181999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15971.500167999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15976.715350999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15981.008479,"samples":29496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":17742.404167,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18105.828771,"text":"isolata dal resto del mondo."},{"kind":"audio","t":18308.184824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18312.123359,"samples":28432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":26292.532936,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":27247.912663,"text":"Oggi le persone scrivono messaggi sugli schermi dei computer senza dover mai più avvicinarsi a un temperino."},{"kind":"audio","t":27361.858827,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27366.865894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27372.236254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27377.378119,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27381.760626,"samples":30928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":37531.139870000006,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":38937.748210000005,"text":"I viaggiatori diretti verso paesi con una tassazione elevata possono a volte risparmiare una somma considerevole, specialmente su prodotti come bevande alcoliche e tabacco."},{"kind":"audio","t":39061.149627000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39066.464238,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39071.848779,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39077.079742,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39082.246386000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":39087.527378000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39092.050883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39094.043289,"samples":25024,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":45787.361039,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46437.075110000005,"text":"Le piante producono il proprio nutrimento dal sole attraverso la fotosintesi. Forniscono anche ombra."},{"kind":"audio","t":46536.843341,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46542.155092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46547.321196000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46550.502313000005,"samples":24696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"audio","t":46603.068289,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46605.56161700001,"samples":20032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":58075.887257,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":59278.598408000005,"text":"L'ospedale ha seguito il protocollo per il controllo delle infezioni, inclusa la separazione del paziente dagli altri per prevenire possibili contagi."},{"kind":"audio","t":59492.170385000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59493.546432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59495.117966000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":59496.574182000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59498.206215000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59499.925876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59500.847541,"samples":28392,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":68180.410407,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":69533.34397,"text":"Il lavoro svolto è stato prevalentemente teorico, ma il programma è stato scritto per simulare le osservazioni effettuate sulla galassia di Sagittario."},{"kind":"audio","t":69752.976626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69758.17753999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69763.292234,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69768.648085,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69773.925408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":69779.38169699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69783.497248,"samples":30792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":78543.261291,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":79516.786285,"text":"Le lingue ufficiali di Barcellona sono il catalano e lo spagnolo. Circa la metà preferisce parlare catalano, una vasta maggioranza lo comprende e praticamente tutti conoscono lo spagnolo."},{"kind":"audio","t":79624.31174599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79629.67996699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79635.053777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":79635.23108499999,"samples":6696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":79716.099789,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79721.537319,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":79726.444397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79732.011105,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79737.31230599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79740.58212199999,"samples":25160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":83795.44626499999,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":84717.184641,"text":"In alcune zone è sufficiente far bollire l'acqua per un minuto, mentre in altre ne sono necessari diversi."},{"kind":"audio","t":84825.279973,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84830.677233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84835.90764599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84841.291346,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84845.711963,"samples":30328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":89854.724162,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":90882.711921,"text":"Le piante danno il meglio di sé in un ambiente naturale, quindi resisti alla tentazione di rimuovere anche solo un gambo."},{"kind":"audio","t":90999.598946,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91004.929477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91010.003123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91015.38176399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91020.668106,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91022.579974,"samples":16760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":97276.344476,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98548.800727,"text":"Durante gli anni '20, l'atteggiamento prevalente della maggior parte dei cittadini e delle nazioni era quello del pacifismo e dell'isolamento."},{"kind":"audio","t":98664.529322,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":98665.88532999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98667.388765,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98668.97955799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98670.619911,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98672.215664,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":98672.49412,"samples":10992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":103529.648376,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":104422.78695699999,"text":"Masa Serif era il predatore alfa del suo tempo, quindi non temeva nulla se non altri Mosul."},{"kind":"audio","t":104534.78835399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104539.95346799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104545.142262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104550.571822,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":104551.85824999999,"samples":13528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":113140.783405,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114448.00332799999,"text":"Dalla fondazione di Asuncion nel 1537, il Paraguay è riuscito a mantenere gran parte del suo carattere e della sua identità indigena."},{"kind":"audio","t":114569.423278,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114574.754579,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":114579.995122,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":114585.310163,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114590.702414,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114596.11876299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114601.32126699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":114601.59600199999,"samples":10024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":119869.142611,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":120762.203864,"text":"La malattia è trasportata dai maiali, per poi migrare agli esseri umani attraverso le zanzare."},{"kind":"audio","t":120864.48172299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120869.91280199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":120875.028947,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120880.451437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120882.70554,"samples":17728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":129357.43171399999,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130313.89278200001,"text":"La maggior parte dei moderni telescopi di ricerca sono strutture enormi situate in aree remote con condizioni atmosferiche favorevoli."},{"kind":"audio","t":130424.374194,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130429.584887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130435.08161600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130440.361068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130445.65907,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130451.07649,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130453.43176099999,"samples":21792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":135226.151551,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":136104.392541,"text":"Le persone potrebbero non immaginare che la pazienza e la comprensione siano necessarie anche per i viaggiatori."},{"kind":"audio","t":136221.90847599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136227.268117,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136232.593648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136238.034358,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":136243.692974,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":136243.974029,"samples":7760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":140538.06425199998,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141241.558789,"text":"È quindi probabile che la notazione sia stata aggiunta semplicemente come etichetta."},{"kind":"audio","t":141349.218578,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141350.686803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141352.214988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141353.491897,"samples":31296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":147770.51994199998,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":148468.496591,"text":"Ma ci sono molte cose negli uccelli che somigliano ancora a un dinosauro."},{"kind":"audio","t":148573.526714,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148574.94122,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148576.73621,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148576.992186,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":154957.873233,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":155902.775464,"text":"Sono quasi tutte spiagge sabbiose con balneazione sicura e la maggior parte ha zone d'ombra offerte da"},{"kind":"audio","t":156009.533228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156011.079352,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156012.537898,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156014.028823,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156014.894499,"samples":24328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":158231.752029,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158549.17029799998,"text":"alberi di Pohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":158688.115897,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158688.59156899998,"samples":15832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":164347.277001,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165781.363323,"text":"Duvall, che è sposato e ha due figli adulti, non ha lasciato un'impressione profonda su Miller, al quale è stata riferita la storia."},{"kind":"audio","t":165966.915777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165968.50269999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165969.926286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165971.582599,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165973.081594,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165974.459021,"samples":27560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"close","t":176005.293228,"code":1005}]}